    "_comment": "Text that reaches the hook but was not typed by the user: other sessions, sub-agents, background and scheduled runs. Wrapped blocks are dropped; a prompt that starts with one of the 'starts' patterns (JavaScript regex, case-insensitive) is not the user's at all.",
